title: Slow Blues
key: G
tempo: 60
meter: 12/8
style: blues

// Twelve bars in twelve-eight: four slow beats to the bar, three eighths in
// each. The quick change in bar two, and a turnaround that walks up through
// the four, a chord a beat, and comes to rest on the five.
[A]
| G7 | C7 | G7                | %       |
| C7 | %  | G7                | %       |
| D7 | C7 | G7 G7/B C7 C#dim7 | G7/D D7 |
